557	zis53	49	0	instruments_tools	The questionnaire records the respondent s mood in terms of a personality trait . Bohner and Schwarz divide the construct into the two factors mood and reactivity . The development of the scale is based on the works of Underwood and Froming 1980 .
557	zis52	50	0	instruments_tools	The questionnaire operationalizes four dimensions of aggression physical and verbal aggression as behavioral tendencies anger as an affective component and hostility as a cognitive component. The development of the questionnaire is based on the work of Buss and Perry 1992 .
557	zis71	51	0	instruments_tools	The present questionnaire records the trend towards health related concerns. The development of the scale is based on the work of Salkovskis et al. 2002 and represents the German and abbreviated version of the scale produced by them.
