557	zis58	53	0	instruments_tools	The scale measures anomie the perceived normlessness with four items. The development of the items is based on the work of Srole 1956 . The scale was used several times in a general population survey called Allgemeinen Bevölkerungsumfrage ALLBUS .
557	zis178	54	0	instruments_tools	The scale measures the awareness of consequences of action on a global level with three items. This corresponds to the degree of awareness of the consequences of one s own actions for global environmental changes. The development of the scale is based on the works of Schwartz 1977 1981 .
