60151	zis2	22	10	instruments_tools	Job satisfaction is measured with 79 items. The reliability estimates of the seven subscales my colleagues my supervisor my activity my working conditions organization and performance my development my pay are between 0.81 and 0.91. Several studies indicate the validity of the scales.
