66255	zis157	33	0	instruments_tools	The items documented here capture attitudes to specific foreign groups as well as to foreign nations and cultures in general. Accepting responses to their items affirm a threat experienced by foreign groups and their values and norms and express a suspicious and negative attitude towards them and their integration into one s own society.
