67689	zis148	7	80	instruments_tools	The instrument consists of a an item to capture the strength of the status maintenance motive. It is based on a formulation of questions from the study conducted by Richard Fauser at the University of Konstanz on educational pathways in working class families cf. Fauser 1985 . With three further items the instrument b measures how likely it is for respondents that their children will at least retain their family status if they achieve one of the three school leaving qualifications possible in the Federal Republic of Germany.
